OL,3,GNEWSAWidespread industrial action
OL,4,Abegins across Republic of Ireland
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome health, education and council
OL,7,Fworkers in the Republic of Ireland have
OL,8,Fcommenced industrial action over an
OL,9,Fongoing public sector pay dispute.
OL,11,FMore than 100,000 workers, including
OL,12,Fnurses, school staff and civil
OL,13,Fservants, moved to work-to-rule
OL,14,Fmeasures on Wednesday morning.
OL,16,FThe Irish Nurses and Midwives
OL,17,FOrganisation (INMO) said its public
OL,18,Fhealth service staff will perform only
OL,19,Fduties necessary for safe patient care
OL,20,Fand "will not work any additional
OL,21,Funpaid hours".
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
