OL,3,GNEWSAWidespread industrial action
OL,4,Abegins across Republic of Ireland
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo days of fuller strike action have
OL,7,Fbeen planned for 14 and 21 October,
OL,8,Fwhen it is expected schools could be
OL,9,Fclosed and picket lines formed across
OL,10,Fthe country.
